  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Endowment for Democracy (EED): Support to independent reporting and civic activism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to strengthen the capacity of pro-democracy groups and independent media in restrictive environments to promote and preserve space for freedom of expression, increasing civic and political participation and pluralism, and promoting human rights to pursue long term democracy, prevent conflict and strengthen political dialogue.</narrative>
